:: The Gates of Elsinore [castle]

You stand at the gates of Elsinore Castle. A voice calls "Who's there?"

<<if $gateOpen>>
	The gates stand open.

	[[Enter the castle->Castle Courtyard]]
<<else>>
	The gates are shut fast.

	<<link "Knock">>
		<<set $gateOpen to true>>
		<<goto "The Gates of Elsinore">>
	<</link>>
<</if>>
